#=GF RL Mol Cell Biol 1998;18:6178-6190.
#=GF CC This family represents the vascular endothelial growth factor (VEGF)
#=GF CC internal ribosome entry site (IRES) A. VEGF is an endothelial cell mitogen
#=GF CC with many crucial functions such as embryogenic development and wound
#=GF CC healing. The 5' UTR of VEGF mRNA contains two IRES elements which are able
#=GF CC to promote efficient translation at the AUG start codon [1], this family
#=GF CC represents IRES A.
